# Missing Documents Report for RA and TA Applications

**Author:** Joy Okafor  
**File Path:** `data/reports/missing_documents_ra_ta_apps.xlsx`  
**Date:** March 24, 2026  

## Context
This report outlines the flagged RA (Research Assistant) and TA (Teaching Assistant) applications that are missing required documents. The identified gaps may impact the processing and approval of these applications. Follow-up actions have been initiated by the administration team to resolve these issues promptly.

---

